nos (0.9.5~pre-alpha-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Renamed from nithronos: NithronOS is now nOS. The nithronos package is
    now a transitional package that depends on nos.
  * nos-certgen.service is installed under /lib/systemd/system.
  * Align the package version with the nOS release (0.9.5-pre-alpha); the
    VERSION file at the repository root is now the single source.

